(144, 1, '2025-08-03', '05:31:05', '17:04:54', '05:31:00', '18:04:00', 'Overtime Clarification – Sunday Shift - 03.08.2025\r\n\r\nI worked a regular schedule from 6:00 AM to 5:00 PM Sunday and also rendered 1 hour of overtime afterward. However, I accidentally missed selecting the “Request Overtime” button.\r\n\r\nThis concern has also been escalated to our Team Lead, Francis for visibility.\r\n\r\nLogout Time: 6:04 PM\r\nPlease see the attached file for reference.', 'Pending', '2025-08-03 18:12:31', 'attach_688f360fc8a5a3.61867757.png', '2025-08-03 18:12:31', 0, 0),
